      "desc": "[sound] Vocalization. Plays pre-set voice.\n\nkakuritsu255 is,\n255 = 100%\n160 = 63%\n128 = 50%\n64 = 25%\n32 = 12.5%\n0 = Same as 100%.\n-1 = Probability according to level. See below.\n\nWhen -1, specifically ATVLV_0 = 25%, ATVLV_1 = 128%, ATVLV_2 = 100%.\nThese numbers were decided based on the most common distribution of AttackVoice in Guilty Gear.\n2018/11/06 nozawa: Changed probability for Xrd3. -> (ATVLV_0 = 25%, ATVLV_1 = 33%, ATVLV_2 = 50%)\n2019/09/26 nozawa: Changed probability to be set in SetupVoice.",
