    "1025": {
      "name": "DustEndLockParamClear",
      "arguments": [
        {
          "Type": "COperand",
          "Name": "val"
        }
      ],
      "desc": "2021/05/21 GGST kinoshita: Fix for issue where characters are not unlocked when lock is active at the end of Dust.\nUnlocks the relevant lock state from the calling character.\nIntended for use only in Dust end processing, please read on both players.\nIf the position is reset to 0 when unlocking and the character lands in the air, you can set the Y coordinate as an argument to set that coordinate temporarily and prevent landing.\nIf there are no issues, please generally set some value.\nFirst argument val: If a value other than 0 is specified, PosY is set to that value.\nPlease do not use this outside of Dust end processing unless absolutely necessary. If used, please thoroughly check the behavior.",
      "indent": null
    },
