          "Name": "arg4"
        },
        {
          "Type": "S32",
          "Name": "arg5"
        },
        {
          "Type": "S32",
          "Name": "arg6"
        }
      ],
      "desc": ".jex Add collision setting (currently only for Afro collision).\ntag\t\t\tAdd collision identifier name (can be anything but keep within 32 characters).\ntype\t\tAdd collision type (EXTEND_JON_AFRO for Afro).\nbehavior\tBehavior (what kind of collision it is -> specify from the list of CT_COLLISION_TYPE *currently fixed damage so ignored even if specified).\nx\t\t\tX difference from add collision point (currently fixed to collision centered on the point so ignored).\ny\t\t\tY difference from add collision point (currently fixed to collision centered on the point so ignored).\nw\t\t\tCollision width.\nh\t\t\tCollision height.",
      "indent": null
    },
