          "Type": "COperand",
          "Name": "intervalFrame"
        },
        {
          "Type": "COperand",
          "Name": "accType"
        }
      ],
      "desc": "Blends the pose of another cell with the current cell's pose (searches for the next CellBegin and blends).\nrateVar: Percentage to blend (0~1000). Variables can also be used.\nblendFrame: Number of frames to blend over.\nblendInterval: Blend update interval.\nblendAcc: Blend acceleration type. Same as Adventure. (0: Normal, 1: Decelerate, 2: Accelerate, 3: Accelerate then decelerate, 4: Rapid deceleration, 5: Rapid acceleration, 6: Rapid acceleration then rapid deceleration).",
      "indent": null
    },
