    "2029": {
      "name": "ExHoming",
      "arguments": [
        {
          "Type": "Enum",
          "EnumName": "EXHOMING",
          "Name": "type"
        },
        {
          "Type": "Enum",
          "EnumName": "CO_TYPE",
          "Name": "object"
        },
        {
          "Type": "Enum",
          "EnumName": "POS_TYPE",
          "Name": "pos"
        },
        {
          "Type": "COperand",
          "Name": "offsetX"
        },
        {
          "Type": "COperand",
          "Name": "offsetY"
        },
        {
          "Type": "COperand",
          "Name": "paramA"
        },
        {
          "Type": "COperand",
          "Name": "paramB"
        }
      ],
      "desc": "Homing setting.\n\nDescription of paramA and paramB below.\n\nEXHOMING_DistanceAccel,\nCauses acceleration to change according to distance. Speed is overwritten.\nparamA: Acceleration amount. 100 reaches instantly. This additive value changes with distance.\nparamB: Value per-ed to speed every frame. 100 is very slippery. 0 is not slippery.\nFirst, testing with around 10, 50 is recommended.\n\nEXHOMING_FixAccel,\nAlways follows with constant acceleration. Speed is overwritten.\nparamA: Acceleration amount.\nparamB: Value per-ed to speed every frame. 100 is very slippery. 0 is not slippery.\nFirst, testing with around 20000, 50 is recommended.\n\nEXHOMING_ToSpeed,\nRecommended!\nConverges to a constant speed. Speed is overwritten.\nparamA: Target speed.\nparamB: How much to approach that speed. Not a percentage.\nFirst, testing with around 30000, 1000 is recommended.",
      "indent": null
    },
